This product bundles HRTF data from the CIPIC HRTF Database and the SADIE II
Database. It also bundles project-compiled acoustic-material and ResPlan scene
databases. Attribution, source references, and data-license notes are recorded
in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and in the metadata embedded in each SOFA file.

Acoustic Materials DB includes records attributed to PTB, ODEON and identified
manufacturers, Pyroomacoustics, JCW Acoustic Supplies, and SoundSpaces. The
project adds VLM-assisted semantic mappings and a normalized runtime schema.
The database has mixed upstream terms; see its packaged DATA_LICENSE.md.
